# Brand colors

When JD says "brand orange", "logo orange", "our orange" (same for blue, green, other colors already on the site), use the **existing site/logo color** - never invent a new one.

- Logo orange: `--color-accent-vivid` (`#e85545`, same as `--hw-hourglass-sun`)
- Brand blue: `--color-brand-blue` (`#67c4eb`)
- Green: `--color-green` (`#4ade80`)
- WS audio play button: `.hw-audio-chrome__play` (blue bg, navy glyph `--hw-hourglass-stroke`)

No new colors unless JD explicitly asks.
